    <main>

        <section id="about">
            <h2>About the Story</h2>

            <p>
                Coco and Eliot are two best friends who are always getting
                themselves into unexpected situations. What starts as a normal
                day quickly turns into an adventure when they realize something
                important has gone missing.
            </p>

            <p>
                The two friends have very different personalities, but
                <strong>they work best as a team.</strong>
            </p>
        </section>


        <section id="characters">
            <h2>Meet the Characters</h2>

            <h3>Coco</h3>

            <img src="images/coco.jpg" alt="Cartoon drawing of Coco" width="300">

            <p>
                Coco has bleach blonde hair and huge glasses that take up almost
                half of her face. She is curious, dramatic, and usually the first
                person to suggest doing something slightly chaotic.
            </p>

            <h3>Eliot</h3>

            <img src="images/eliot.jpg" alt="Cartoon drawing of Eliot" width="300">

            <p>
                Eliot has dirty blonde hair, thick eyebrows, long eyelashes, and
                a soft button nose. She is usually more observant than Coco and
                tries to think things through before making a decision.
            </p>

            <p>
                Even though they are different, they are <em>best friends.</em>
            </p>
        </section>


        <section id="adventure">
            <h2>The Adventure</h2>

            <p>
                Coco and Eliot have to follow clues around town to figure out
                what happened and find what they are looking for.
            </p>

            <h3>What They Need</h3>

            <ul>
                <li>Coco's giant glasses</li>
                <li>Eliot's detective skills</li>
                <li>A phone</li>
                <li>Snacks</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Their Plan</h3>

            <ol>
                <li>Go back to the last place they remember having the missing item.</li>
                <li>Look for clues.</li>
                <li>Ask people if they saw anything.</li>
                <li>Follow the clues.</li>
                <li>Find the missing item.</li>
            </ol>

            <p>
                Their main rule is to <mark>never split up.</mark>
            </p>
        </section>


        <section id="gallery">
            <h2>Gallery</h2>

